---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
	<div class="prose">
		<h1>About</h1>
		<p>
			I'm an investment research analyst with a passion for markets. This is my personal portfolio of investment
			theses: each call is timestamped, tracked against market prices, and kept on the record whether it worked or not.
		</p>
		<p>I publish as <strong>Alpha Beta Generator</strong>.</p>

		<h2 id="disclaimer">Disclaimer</h2>
		<p>
			This site is a personal record of my own investment views. It is not investment advice, a recommendation to buy
			or sell any security, or an offer or solicitation of any kind. Nothing here takes account of your objectives,
			financial situation or needs. Do your own research and, where appropriate, consult a licensed adviser before
			making any investment decision.
		</p>
		<p>
			These views are mine alone. They are not the views of my employer or any organisation I am or have been
			associated with, and they are not based on any non-public information.
		</p>
		<p>
			I may or may not hold positions in the instruments discussed, and I may change my positions at any time without
			updating this site.
		</p>
		<p>
			Prices and returns are calculated from third-party data (Yahoo Finance) and may contain errors. Past performance
			is not a reliable indicator of future results. All investments carry risk, including the loss of capital.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>

<style>
	.prose {
		max-width: 44rem;
	}
	h2 {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem;
		scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
	}
</style>
